 back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786990/extras/00c6f1f7f82837186236c62fd91ddf1d.avif?t=1781244053\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786990/extras_big/00c6f1f7f82837186236c62fd91ddf1d.avif?t=1781244053 width=800 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786990/extras/4754605a4638d43c7055872c45b7424e.poster.avif?t=1781244053\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786990/extras/4754605a4638d43c7055872c45b7424e.webm?t=1781244053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786990/extras/4754605a4638d43c7055872c45b7424e.mp4?t=1781244053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The horrors of Happy Door don't manifest in ordinary ways. An unnatural humming, the trembling of nearby objects—these are your only warnings as entities spawn. Rally your team and unleash light upon them to halt the summoning! Your staff isn't just a simple lamp—it's your only defense for keeping the horror at bay.</p>", "short_description": "Magic, Horror, Co-op Survive together in Happy Door, a mysterious space with fellow wizards. Gather resources through co-op play and purchase powerful spells to endure the horror.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Greek, Dutch, Norwegian, Danish, Russian, Romanian, Vietnamese, Bulgarian, Swedish, Spanish - Latin America, Arabic, Ukrainian, Indonesian, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Czech, Thai, Turkish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Polish, Finnish, Korean, Hungarian<br><strong>*